  "prompt": "How much MRR did the annual plans bill in 2025, in each currency? An annual subscription bills twelve months of its MRR at once, on its start day and on each anniversary of it (the same month and day in a later year; no annual subscription starts on 29 February); its other invoices bill the rest of a year after it grew, so leave them out. Use those invoices dated from 1 January to 31 December 2025. Return three columns, in this order: currency, invoices (how many such invoices) and renewal_mrr, the MRR they bill in that currency, worked out from each invoice's amount_local. Return one row for each currency with such an invoice. Any row order is fine.",
